    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-09-09",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Local School Foods Expansion Act of 2025 </strong></p><p>This bill expands and otherwise revises a program to support state procurement of domestically grown unprocessed fruits and vegetables under the National School Lunch Program.</p><p>Specifically, the bill expands the number of participating states from a maximum of 8 to a maximum of 14. </p><p>In addition,&nbsp;the bill&nbsp;establishes additional requirements with respect to priorities, reporting, and evaluations, including with respect to socially disadvantaged populations and the program's economic impact.</p><p>The bill provides funds for the program through FY2030.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-09-17T17:22:53Z"
      }
    ]
  },
